SQL Business Analytics

The SQL analysis answers several business questions, including:

Revenue Analysis
Which category generates the highest revenue?
Which locations contribute the most sales?
Customer Analysis
Which age group spends the most?
Who are the top-spending customers?
Marketing Analysis
Does subscription status affect spending?
Do discounts increase purchase amounts?
Operational Analysis
Which payment method is most preferred?
Which shipping method generates maximum revenue?
Seasonal Analysis
Which season records the highest sales?
