Business KPI Monitoring
Key Insights
Product categories contribute differently to overall revenue.
Customer spending varies across age groups.
Seasonal patterns significantly influence sales.
Discounts impact purchasing behavior.
Subscription programs affect customer engagement.
Certain payment methods dominate customer preferences.
Repeat customers contribute substantially to revenue.
How to Run the Project
Clone the Repository
git clone https://github.com/Varun-Ba/customer-shopping-behavior-analysis.git
Install Dependencies
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn
Open Jupyter Notebook
jupyter notebook

Run:

Data Cleaning and EDA.ipynb
Execute SQL Queries

Import the dataset into PostgreSQL and run:

Buisness_Questions.sql
Open Power BI Dashboard
Customer Shopping Behavior.pbix

using Power BI Desktop.

